{"route":"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/","title":"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use | Data Foundations Tutorial","description":"Legal permission is not the only test. Learn purpose limitation, data minimization, privacy, security, fairness, transparency, and responsible communication.","canonical":"https://datalearninghub.netlify.app/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/","bodyAttrs":{"data-page":"tutorial-chapter","data-tutorial":"data-foundations","data-chapter":"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use"},"mainHtml":"<main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"tutorial-layout\">\n<aside class=\"tutorial-sidebar\" id=\"tutorial-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-head\">\n<a class=\"tutorial-course-title\" data-bn=\"ডেটা ফাউন্ডেশন\" data-en=\"Data Foundations\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/\">Data Foundations</a>\n<button aria-label=\"Close chapter menu\" class=\"icon-button tutorial-drawer-close\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-close\" type=\"button\">×</button>\n</div>\n<label class=\"tutorial-sidebar-search\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Search chapters</span><input data-placeholder-bn=\"Chapter খুঁজুন…\" data-placeholder-en=\"Search chapters…\" id=\"tutorial-chapter-search\" placeholder=\"Search chapters…\" type=\"search\"/></label>\n<div class=\"tutorial-progress-mini\"><div><span data-bn=\"Course progress\" data-en=\"Course progress\">Course progress</span><strong id=\"tutorial-progress-label\">0/21</strong></div><div class=\"progress-track\"><span id=\"tutorial-progress-bar\" style=\"width:0\"></span></div></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"Course chapters\" class=\"tutorial-chapter-nav\"><div class=\"tutorial-module-links\"><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"welcome-to-data-analytics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/welcome-to-data-analytics/\"><span>01</span><span data-bn=\"ডেটা অ্যানালিটিক্সে স্বাগতম\" data-en=\"Welcome to Data Analytics\">Welcome to Data Analytics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-and-statistics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-and-statistics/\"><span>02</span><span data-bn=\"ডেটা ও স্ট্যাটিস্টিকস\" data-en=\"Data and Statistics\">Data and Statistics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"observations-variables-and-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/observations-variables-and-values/\"><span>03</span><span data-bn=\"Observation, Variable ও Value\" data-en=\"Observations, Variables, and Values\">Observations, Variables, and Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"rows-columns-tables-and-datasets\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/rows-columns-tables-and-datasets/\"><span>04</span><span data-bn=\"Row, Column, Table ও Dataset\" data-en=\"Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets\">Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"categorical-and-numerical-data\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/categorical-and-numerical-data/\"><span>05</span><span data-bn=\"Categorical ও Numerical Data\" data-en=\"Categorical and Numerical Data\">Categorical and Numerical Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"discrete-and-continuous-data\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/discrete-and-continuous-data/\"><span>06</span><span data-bn=\"Discrete ও Continuous Data\" data-en=\"Discrete and Continuous Data\">Discrete and Continuous Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"measurement-scales\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/measurement-scales/\"><span>07</span><span data-bn=\"Measurement Scale\" data-en=\"Measurement Scales\">Measurement Scales</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link current\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 20 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 20 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 20 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Legal permission একমাত্র test নয়। Purpose limitation, data minimization, privacy, security, fairness, transparency ও responsible communication শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Legal permission is not the only test. Learn purpose limitation, data minimization, privacy, security, fairness, transparency, and responsible communication.\">Legal permission is not the only test. Learn purpose limitation, data minimization, privacy, security, fairness, transparency, and responsible communication.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 55 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Data lifecycle জুড়ে ethical risk identify করুন।\" data-en=\"Identify ethical risks across the data lifecycle.\">Identify ethical risks across the data lifecycle.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Purpose limitation ও data minimization apply করুন।\" data-en=\"Apply purpose limitation and data minimization.\">Apply purpose limitation and data minimization.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Anonymisation ও শুধু name removal আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Distinguish anonymisation from simple removal of names.\">Distinguish anonymisation from simple removal of names.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Uncertainty ও limitation honestly communicate করুন।\" data-en=\"Communicate uncertainty and limitations honestly.\">Communicate uncertainty and limitations honestly.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Purpose ও proportionality\" data-en=\"Purpose and proportionality\">Purpose and proportionality</h2><p data-bn=\"Clear, legitimate purpose-এর জন্য data collect/use করুন। প্রতিটি field necessary কি না এবং less intrusive method question answer করতে পারে কি না জিজ্ঞেস করুন। এক purpose-এর data people reasonably expect করবে না এমনভাবে silently repurpose করবেন না।\" data-en=\"Collect and use data for a clear, legitimate purpose. Ask whether each field is necessary and whether a less intrusive method can answer the question. Data collected for one purpose should not silently be repurposed in ways people would not reasonably expect.\">Collect and use data for a clear, legitimate purpose. Ask whether each field is necessary and whether a less intrusive method can answer the question. Data collected for one purpose should not silently be repurposed in ways people would not reasonably expect.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Privacy ও security\" data-en=\"Privacy and security\">Privacy and security</h2><p data-bn=\"Privacy appropriate collection, access, use, sharing ও retention নিয়ে। Security unauthorized access, alteration ও loss থেকে protect করে। Name remove করলেই anonymisation নয়; age, location, date বা rare event combination re-identify করতে পারে।\" data-en=\"Privacy concerns appropriate collection, access, use, sharing, and retention. Security protects data against unauthorized access, alteration, and loss. Removing names is not always anonymisation: combinations of age, location, date, or rare events may re-identify people.\">Privacy concerns appropriate collection, access, use, sharing, and retention. Security protects data against unauthorized access, alteration, and loss. Removing names is not always anonymisation: combinations of age, location, date, or rare events may re-identify people.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Fairness ও representation\" data-en=\"Fairness and representation\">Fairness and representation</h2><p data-bn=\"Missing coverage, historical inequity, biased label, unsuitable proxy বা unequal error rate-এর মাধ্যমে data/model group disadvantage করতে পারে। শুধু overall accuracy নয়, subgroup performance ও harm assess করুন। Sensitive characteristic defensible need ও safeguard ছাড়া use করবেন না।\" data-en=\"Data and models can disadvantage groups through missing coverage, historical inequity, biased labels, unsuitable proxies, or unequal error rates. Assess subgroup performance and harms, not only overall accuracy. Avoid using protected or sensitive characteristics without a defensible need and safeguards.\">Data and models can disadvantage groups through missing coverage, historical inequity, biased labels, unsuitable proxies, or unequal error rates. Assess subgroup performance and harms, not only overall accuracy. Avoid using protected or sensitive characteristics without a defensible need and safeguards.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-4\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">04</div><h2 data-bn=\"Responsible communication\" data-en=\"Responsible communication\">Responsible communication</h2><p data-bn=\"Causality, precision বা certainty exaggerate করবেন না। Denominator, time period, definition ও important uncertainty দেখান। Misleading visual scale ও selective filter এড়ান। কে missing এবং evidence কোন decision support করে না তা state করুন।\" data-en=\"Do not exaggerate causality, precision, or certainty. Show denominators, time periods, definitions, and important uncertainty. Avoid visual scales and selective filters that mislead. State who may be missing and what decision the evidence cannot support.\">Do not exaggerate causality, precision, or certainty. Show denominators, time periods, definitions, and important uncertainty. Avoid visual scales and selective filters that mislead. State who may be missing and what decision the evidence cannot support.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Data minimization\" data-en=\"Data minimization\">Data minimization</h3><p data-bn=\"Defined purpose-এর জন্য necessary data-ই collect ও retain করা।\" data-en=\"Collecting and retaining only data necessary for a defined purpose.\">Collecting and retaining only data necessary for a defined purpose.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Anonymisation\" data-en=\"Anonymisation\">Anonymisation</h3><p data-bn=\"Reasonably available means দিয়ে individual আর identifiable না থাকে এমন processing।\" data-en=\"Processing data so individuals are no longer identifiable with reasonably available means.\">Processing data so individuals are no longer identifiable with reasonably available means.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Fairness\" data-en=\"Fairness\">Fairness</h3><p data-bn=\"Data use unjustified unequal benefit, error বা harm তৈরি করে কি না assessment।\" data-en=\"Assessment of whether data use creates unjustified unequal benefits, errors, or harms.\">Assessment of whether data use creates unjustified unequal benefits, errors, or harms.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Purpose limitation\" data-en=\"Purpose limitation\">Purpose limitation</h3><p data-bn=\"Specified, legitimate ও compatible purpose-এ data use করা।\" data-en=\"Using data only for specified, legitimate, compatible purposes.\">Using data only for specified, legitimate, compatible purposes.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Healthcare dashboard publish\" data-en=\"Publishing a healthcare dashboard\">Publishing a healthcare dashboard</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"Public dashboard monthly visit area, age group, diagnosis category ও clinic অনুযায়ী দেখাবে।\" data-en=\"A public dashboard would show monthly visits by area, age group, diagnosis category, and clinic.\">A public dashboard would show monthly visits by area, age group, diagnosis category, and clinic.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Public reporting purpose ও legal basis confirm করুন।\" data-en=\"Confirm public reporting purpose and legal basis.\">Confirm public reporting purpose and legal basis.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Unnecessary field remove ও aggregated group ব্যবহার করুন।\" data-en=\"Remove unnecessary fields and use aggregated groups.\">Remove unnecessary fields and use aggregated groups.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"Small cell ও identifying combination assess করুন।\" data-en=\"Assess small cells and combinations that may identify individuals.\">Assess small cells and combinations that may identify individuals.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Access, suppression ও retention control apply করুন।\" data-en=\"Apply access, suppression, and retention controls.\">Apply access, suppression, and retention controls.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"Subgroup fairness ও stigmatizing label review করুন।\" data-en=\"Review subgroup fairness and stigmatizing labels.\">Review subgroup fairness and stigmatizing labels.</p></li><li><span>6</span><p data-bn=\"Definition, coverage ও limitation publish করুন।\" data-en=\"Publish definitions, coverage, and limitations.\">Publish definitions, coverage, and limitations.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Responsible publication usefulness-এর সঙ্গে privacy, fairness ও harm risk balance করে।\" data-en=\"Responsible publication balances usefulness with privacy, fairness, and the risk of harm.\">Responsible publication balances usefulness with privacy, fairness, and the risk of harm.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Clear ও compatible purpose-এ data ব্যবহার করুন।\" data-en=\"Use data for clear and compatible purposes.\">Use data for clear and compatible purposes.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Collection ও access minimize করুন।\" data-en=\"Minimize collection and access.\">Minimize collection and access.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Name remove করলেও re-identification prevent নাও হতে পারে।\" data-en=\"Removing names may not prevent re-identification.\">Removing names may not prevent re-identification.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Fairness ও honest communication analytical responsibility।\" data-en=\"Fairness and honest communication are analytical responsibilities.\">Fairness and honest communication are analytical responsibilities.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://ico.org.uk/for-organisations/uk-gdpr-guidance-and-resources/data-sharing/anonymisation/about-this-guidance/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ICO — Anonymisation Guidance ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/SpecialPublications/1500-18/NIST.SP.1500-18r2.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST Research Data Framework ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}